#: Content/Notes/Tunnel of Water Trees/Tunnel of Water Trees Torn Page 1.asset
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "NoteInfo.Assets/Content/Notes/Tunnel of Water Trees/Tunnel of Water Trees Torn Page 1.asset.title"
msgid "Torn Page 1"
msgstr "Página rasgada 1"

#: Content/Notes/Tunnel of Water Trees/Tunnel of Water Trees Torn Page 1.asset
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "NoteInfo.Assets/Content/Notes/Tunnel of Water Trees/Tunnel of Water Trees Torn Page 1.asset.content"
msgid ""
"...One of the sources was supposed to be out here in the middle of nowhere, but the meters showed nothing. It felt exhausting to come such a long way without finding anything. \n"
"\n"
"I wrote the coordinates down with a red pencil and drew a fish next to them. A red herring, after all. Or was it?\n"
"\n"
"Looking back on it now, the source might have been buried so deep underground that the meters simply couldn't detect it, or maybe it was somewhere up in the sky..."
msgstr ""
"...Uma das fontes devia estar aqui fora, no meio do nada, mas os medidores não mostraram nada. Foi exaustivo vir de tão longe sem encontrar coisa alguma. \n"
"\n"
"Anotei as coordenadas com um lápis vermelho e desenhei um peixe ao lado. Uma história de pescador, afinal. Ou não?\n"
"\n"
"Olhando para trás agora, a fonte talvez estivesse enterrada tão fundo que os medidores simplesmente não conseguiam detectá-la, ou talvez estivesse em algum lugar lá no céu..."

#: Content/Notes/Tunnel of Water Trees/Tunnel of Water Trees Torn Page 2.asset
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "NoteInfo.Assets/Content/Notes/Tunnel of Water Trees/Tunnel of Water Trees Torn Page 2.asset.title"
msgid "Torn Page 2"
msgstr "Página rasgada 2"

#: Content/Notes/Tunnel of Water Trees/Tunnel of Water Trees Torn Page 2.asset
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "NoteInfo.Assets/Content/Notes/Tunnel of Water Trees/Tunnel of Water Trees Torn Page 2.asset.content"
msgid ""
"My diving suit grew heavier with every passing second, the abyssal pressure threatening to crush me in the pitch black.\n"
"\n"
"Suddenly, a single, blinding flash seared my eyes.\n"
"\n"
"When my vision cleared, I found myself adrift inside a submerged concrete tunnel. The walls of the tunnel were covered in a brown, slimy matter that looked like it was leaking from cracks in the concrete ceiling. Sprouting from the muck on the floor were pulsing red anomalies.\n"
"\n"
"They were like red, luminous trees under the water..."
msgstr ""
"Meu traje de mergulho ficava mais pesado a cada segundo, e a pressão abissal ameaçava me esmagar na escuridão total.\n"
"\n"
"De repente, um único clarão ofuscante queimou meus olhos.\n"
"\n"
"Quando minha visão clareou, eu me vi à deriva dentro de um túnel de concreto submerso. As paredes do túnel estavam cobertas por uma matéria marrom e viscosa que parecia vazar das rachaduras no teto de concreto. Do lodo no chão brotavam anomalias vermelhas pulsantes.\n"
"\n"
"Pareciam árvores vermelhas e luminosas debaixo d'água..."

#: Content/Notes/Tunnel of Water Trees/Tunnel of Water Trees Torn Page 3.asset
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "NoteInfo.Assets/Content/Notes/Tunnel of Water Trees/Tunnel of Water Trees Torn Page 3.asset.title"
msgid "Torn Page 3"
msgstr "Página rasgada 3"

#: Content/Notes/Tunnel of Water Trees/Tunnel of Water Trees Torn Page 3.asset
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "NoteInfo.Assets/Content/Notes/Tunnel of Water Trees/Tunnel of Water Trees Torn Page 3.asset.content"
msgid ""
"...Every step felt heavier and heavier, and that bright light at the end of the tunnel did not seem to get any closer. \n"
"\n"
"It was almost impossible to avoid those glowing red trees that felt like they were made of electricity..."
msgstr ""
"...Cada passo parecia mais pesado que o anterior, e aquela luz forte no fim do túnel não parecia ficar mais perto. \n"
"\n"
"Era quase impossível desviar daquelas árvores vermelhas brilhantes que pareciam feitas de eletricidade..."

#: Content/Notes/Tunnel of Water Trees/Tunnel of Water Trees Torn Page 4.asset
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "NoteInfo.Assets/Content/Notes/Tunnel of Water Trees/Tunnel of Water Trees Torn Page 4.asset.title"
msgid "Torn Page 4"
msgstr "Página rasgada 4"

#: Content/Notes/Tunnel of Water Trees/Tunnel of Water Trees Torn Page 4.asset
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "NoteInfo.Assets/Content/Notes/Tunnel of Water Trees/Tunnel of Water Trees Torn Page 4.asset.content"
msgid ""
"...He possessed such a charming and intelligent mind, paired with a remarkably kind heart. It made me sick to see someone like him end up this way, and the fact that I left so much unsaid between us just made the pain worse. After all the suffering we had endured, I refused to accept this.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"...Ele tinha uma mente tão encantadora e inteligente, aliada a um coração extraordinariamente bondoso. Me fazia mal ver alguém como ele terminar assim, e saber que deixei tanta coisa por dizer entre nós só piorava a dor. Depois de todo o sofrimento que tínhamos passado, eu me recusava a aceitar aquilo.\n"
"\n"

#: Content/Notes/Tunnel of Water Trees/Tunnel of Water Trees Torn Page 5.asset
#, fuzzy
